SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox Hike
DESCRIPTION:Welcome Autumn with TLC!\nJoin naturalist Julie Hall on a 2.5-mile nature investigation around Williamson Nature Preserve. Julie will lead the group along Two Ponds Loop and Pine Warbler Trail to teach you how to make observations about the nature around you. This family-friendly hike will end with an opportunity to view the sunset over the fields as the autumnal equinox approaches.\n\nRemember to bring a full bottle of water\, and a lawn chair or picnic blanket to watch sunset with. This is a free event\, but space is limited and pre-registration is required.\n\n\n\n\n\nIf registration is full\, please fill out the waitlist form here by September 20th at noon. 
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/autumn-equinox-hike
LOCATION:Williamson Nature Preserve [Staff Entrance]\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27610\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
